      "writtenOn": "2024-08-22T06:07:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They are not the same.\n\n`stopBigMonitoring()` stops and clears both `mPausedBroadcastSinks`, `mPausedBroadcastIds` no matter what.\n\n`checkAndStopBigMonitoring()` checks and clears only `mPausedBroadcastIds` if needed. `mPausedBroadcastSinks` has to remain as they could be stopped by host and need to be resumed after all.\n\n`stopBigMonitoring(int broadcastId, boolean hostInitiated)` is dedicated to use per broadcastId.\n\n\nI don\u0027t see easy way to merge them without losing readability.",
